---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service | DecoSupplier" description="Terms governing use of the DecoSupplier website, product information, inquiries, quotations, samples, and business communications.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:py-16 lg:px-8">
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary-700)]">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: August 14, 2026</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">These Terms govern your use of the DecoSupplier website. By accessing the website or submitting an inquiry, you agree to these Terms.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10 py-10 text-slate-700">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">1. Website Purpose</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">This website provides general information for importers, distributors, contractors, designers, and project buyers evaluating decorative films, flooring, wall panels, and related manufacturing and export services.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Product Information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Images, colors, patterns, measurements, technical descriptions, certifications, packaging, minimum order quantities, lead times, and availability are provided for general reference. Screen settings, lighting, production tolerances, raw materials, and batch variation may affect actual products.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Final specifications must be confirmed in writing through samples, technical sheets, quotations, pro forma invoices, contracts, or other order documents.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">3. Inquiries, Samples, and Quotations</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Submitting an inquiry does not create a purchase contract or guarantee price, availability, exclusivity, production capacity, or delivery date. Quotations remain subject to their stated validity period, payment terms, trade terms, and final written confirmation.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Sample appearance and performance may differ slightly from mass production. Buyers are responsible for confirming suitability, installation requirements, regulatory compliance, and end-use testing before placing an order.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">4. Orders and Commercial Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Confirmed orders are governed by the applicable quotation, pro forma invoice, sales contract, sample approval, and written correspondence. If those documents conflict with these website Terms, the signed or expressly accepted transaction documents control.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">5. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">You must not misuse the website, interfere with its operation, attempt unauthorized access, submit malicious code, impersonate another person or company, scrape content at excessive volume, or use the website for fraudulent, unlawful, or misleading activity.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Website text, layout, branding, product images, catalogs, graphics, and other content are owned by or licensed to DecoSupplier. You may use the website for legitimate sourcing evaluation but may not reproduce, publish, resell, or present its content as your own without written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">7. Disclaimers and Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">The website is provided on an “as available” basis. To the extent permitted by law, DecoSupplier does not guarantee uninterrupted access or that all information is free from errors. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, special, or consequential losses arising solely from use of website content.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">8. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Links to third-party websites and references to logistics, payment, testing, or certification providers are supplied for convenience. Their services and policies are controlled by those third parties.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">9. Changes and Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">We may update these Terms and will publish the revised date on this page. Continued use after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms. Questions may be submitted through our <a href="/contact" class="font-medium text-[var(--color-primary-700)] underline underline-offset-2">Contact page</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
